{"id":"d2463524bbdba63f","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-tensor-product-expansion.md","title":"张量积保持绝对谱展开参数","display":"thm-tensor-product-expansion — 张量积保持绝对谱展开参数","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-tensor-product-expansion","aliases":["28-thm-tensor-product-expansion"],"display":"thm-tensor-product-expansion — 张量积保持绝对谱展开参数","depends_on":["[[28-df-graph-tensor-product]]","[[28-df-spectral-expander]]"],"source_book_location":"Lemma 21.17","source_printed_pages":"436","source_pdf_pages":"462","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"local_proof_reviewed":true,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"proved-in-note; source-statement-compared"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-tensor-product-expansion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-tensor-product-expansion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-tensor-product-expansion — 张量积保持绝对谱展开参数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e714f65d9793749d\" href=\"?note=e714f65d9793749d\" title=\"28-df-graph-tensor-product\">28-df-graph-tensor-product</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"df14955ee1f08cd3\" href=\"?note=df14955ee1f08cd3\" title=\"28-df-spectral-expander\">28-df-spectral-expander</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Lemma 21.17"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"436"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"462"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_reviewed","html":"true"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note; source-statement-compared"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,H\">\\(G,H\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\otimes H\">\\(G\\otimes H\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e714f65d9793749d\" href=\"?note=e714f65d9793749d\" title=\"28-df-graph-tensor-product\">28-df-graph-tensor-product</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"df14955ee1f08cd3\" href=\"?note=df14955ee1f08cd3\" title=\"28-df-spectral-expander\">28-df-spectral-expander</a> 的绝对谱参数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lambda(G\\otimes H)\\le\\max\\{\\lambda(G),\\lambda(H)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lambda(G\\otimes H)\\le\\max\\{\\lambda(G),\\lambda(H)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限实对称转移矩阵有正交特征基；张量基特征值是两图特征值的两两乘积。除均匀×均匀方向外至少一个因子的绝对值受 λ 控制，另一因子至多一。N=1 或 M=1 时该因子的零和空间为零，定义 λ=0，界仍成立。此为原书谱证明的本地复核。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Lemma 21.17；印刷页 436；PDF 页 462。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-graph-tensor-product","status":"resolved","id":"e714f65d9793749d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-graph-tensor-product]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-spectral-expander","status":"resolved","id":"df14955ee1f08cd3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-spectral-expander]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-graph-tensor-pr